<title>USA: US Senate budget chair says happy with budget deal.</title>
<headline>US Senate budget chair says happy with budget deal.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senate Budget Chairman Pete Domenici said Friday he was &quot;very happy&quot; with the budget agreement reached with the White House.</p>
<p>&quot;I'm very happy with the agreement,&quot; the New Mexico Republican said after leaving Senate Majority Leader Trent Lott's office.</p>
</text>
